{"id":"en_the-witch-empress","title":"The Witch Empress","titleEn":"The Witch Empress","description":"Lena Payne enters the imperial palace with five spirit creatures, driven by one goal: avenging her sister. She lives by a single principle—never doubt herself, only strike without mercy. The arrogant noble consort is brought down, and the hypocritical empress is crushed under her assault. Everything shifts when Mario Shane, the tyrannical emperor, falls in love with her and turns into her most devoted defender. The two of them forge a bond that cannot be broken. Those interested in following the series can find it on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/the-witch-empress/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/the-witch-empress/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Animation","Revenge","Romantic","Secret Reveal","Short Drama"],"featured":true,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cd8hc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-witch-empress_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cd8hc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-witch-empress_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cd8hc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-witch-empress_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cd8hc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-witch-empress_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cd8hc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"e